1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,630
Here is how to make cold
brew coffee at home.

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:06,860
First, grind your coffee beans
coarsely, about as rough as sea salt.

3
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:10,170
Put one cup of the ground
coffee into a large glass jar.

4
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:14,680
Pour in four cups of cold, filtered water
and stir gently until all the grounds are

5
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:15,100
wet.

6
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:18,910
Close the lid and leave the jar
in the fridge for 12 to 18 hours.

7
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:23,560
The next day, pour the coffee through a
paper filter or a fine cloth into a clean

8
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:24,180
bottle.

9
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:26,550
What you have now is a strong concentrate.

10
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:32,060
To serve, mix one part concentrate with
one part water or milk and add plenty of

11
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:32,620
ice.

12
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:36,160
Keep the bottle in the fridge and
it stays fresh for about a week.
